      {
        "id": "stukov",
        "name": "Stukov"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Nova works best with Heroes that provide one or many form of engage or crowd control, to help her deal damage with Snipe without the risk of missing too often.\n\nMore importantly, Nova has to be paired with Heroes that make up for her huge lack of waveclear, otherwise your team will struggle doing anything during the game because of enemy Minions constantly giving vision to the enemy team and continually damaging your Structures until they fall."
  },
  "counters": {
    "heroes": [
      {
        "id": "anubarak",
        "name": "Anub'arak"
