    {
      "name": "Snipe Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Nova's Snipe Build provides superior single-target sustain damage against Heroes in the early game and solid area-of-effect damage against Heroes and non-Heroes in the late game.\n\nPerfect Shot at Level 7 drastically increases your damage output, given you can constantly hit enemy Heroes with Snipe. Psionic Efficiency at Level 13 helps you to recover Precision Sniper stacks when you happen to miss enemies with Snipe. Explosive Round at Level 16 provides waveclear and can be used to hit targets that would be otherwise impossible to reach.\n\nChoose this Build when your team needs more waveclear, even though it comes online in the mid game, and when the enemy team features low-mobility Heroes that cannot easily dodge your Snipe.",
